{
  "project": {
    "name": "Hose / Faucet Thread Adapter",
    "slug": "hose-adapter",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "Bridges the mismatched threads people fight with every summer: garden-hose thread (GHT 3/4\"), faucet-aerator threads (M22 / M24), and plain hose barbs. Each end carries a real helical thread or a barbed nozzle, so a hose reaches a sink, a filter, or another hose.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Une las roscas incompatibles que todos peleamos cada verano: rosca de manguera de jardín (GHT 3/4\"), roscas de aireador de grifo (M22 / M24) y espigas de manguera. Cada extremo lleva una rosca helicoidal real o una boquilla con púas, para que una manguera llegue a un fregadero, un filtro u otra manguera.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/hose-adapter.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "hose",
      "adapter",
